 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "The Tyrant's Family Survived by Listening to Her Voice"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "en": "The Tyrant’s Family Lasts Thanks to Her Inner Voice"
   },
   {
    "zh": "Baojun Yijia Kao Ting Ta Xinsheng Xu Ming"
   },
   {
    "zh": "暴君一家靠听她心声续命"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "After being struck to death by someone falling from the sky, Jiu Jiu found herself causing a commotion in the King of Hell’s palace. To resolve the chaos, the King of Hell allowed her to enter the world of a book, where she became a princess. However, she was no ordinary princess—she was confined to the cold palace. From the start, due to the heroine’s slander, her tyrant father decided to sentence her to death. Jiu Jiu was left speechless, thinking to herself: “No wonder the Xi Chu kingdom collapses 10 years later. With such an indiscriminate tyrant, the fact that it even lasts 10 years is a miracle.”"
  },
